# Copy to android/keystore.properties (gitignored) OR leave it absent to use the default
# ~/.config/pointhub-android/keystore.properties.
#
# It points at the ONE release key. Every build must be signed with it: losing it means the
# installed tablets can never be updated again (uninstall + reinstall, losing their backups).
#
# Either an indirection to the real file:
propertiesFile=/home/lucanepa/.config/pointhub-android/keystore.properties
# ...or the four keys directly (never commit a filled-in copy):
# storeFile=/home/lucanepa/.config/pointhub-android/release.jks
# storePassword=...
# keyAlias=pointhub
# keyPassword=...
